    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>fantasy shop is a medieval shop management game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order and sell new goods in your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop, organize, decorate your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strive to be the biggest shop. Find a way to avoid the king's taxes. Enjoy various activities that will take place inside the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306840/extras/17f3c35daf429d9822626137688d524f.poster.avif?t=1754796995\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306840/extras/17f3c35daf429d9822626137688d524f.webm?t=1754796995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306840/extras/17f3c35daf429d9822626137688d524f.mp4?t=1754796995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Start your journey from a humble shop to the most renowned trading hall in the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your walls, add new rooms, and fill your displays with shelves and counters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each upgrade means more customers and more valuable goods!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Single Player Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Decoration and Build Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf 50 Available Decorations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf 100 Items Ready to Trade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf King Taxes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Potion Craft</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Item Upgrade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Seasonal Events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Buy and Rent A House</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>fantasy shop is a medieval shop management game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order and sell new goods in your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop, organize, decorate your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strive to be the biggest shop. Find a way to avoid the king's taxes. Enjoy various activities that will take place inside the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306840/extras/17f3c35daf429d9822626137688d524f.poster.avif?t=1754796995\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306840/extras/17f3c35daf429d9822626137688d524f.webm?t=1754796995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306840/extras/17f3c35daf429d9822626137688d524f.mp4?t=1754796995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Start your journey from a humble shop to the most renowned trading hall in the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your walls, add new rooms, and fill your displays with shelves and counters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each upgrade means more customers and more valuable goods!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Single Player Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Decoration and Build Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf 50 Available Decorations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf 100 Items Ready to Trade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf King Taxes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Potion Craft</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Item Upgrade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Seasonal Events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Buy and Rent A House</p>",
